<title>UK: Capital Radio appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Capital Radio appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Radio Plc said on Wednesday that Peter Harris, who joined the company two years ago, is to become finance director with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Harris, 34, has previously been company secretary and head of corporate finance at Capital Radio.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
